   "title": "Urine flow BLOCKED: WHERE, and how BAD?",
   "lines": [
    "hydronephrosis (dilated pelvis + calyces) on ultrasound or computed tomography (CT) · it can occur WITHOUT a block (reflux)",
    "worse if: COMPLETE · BOTH sides · INFECTED (speeds nephron loss) · > 6 WEEKS complete = function lost for good"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "g_up",
