   "h": 96,
   "kind": "plain",
   "title": "UPPER tract, one side: RENAL COLIC from a stone",
   "lines": [
    "severe one-sided flank pain in WAVES → groin, scrotum or labia · hematuria · vomiting",
    "1 · CT (most sensitive) · ultrasound sees every stone · plain x-ray MISSES uric acid stones",
    "~also think: aortic aneurysm, pyelonephritis, a mass, musculoskeletal"
   ]
  },
